 "formNotes": {
  "25": "Caps: Ash’s Pikachu, can’t evolve or breed; World Cap by Sword/Shield event, the other seven only from HOME. No cosplay, Let’s Go partner or other Pikachu forms on Serebii’s Sword & Shield page.",
  "52": "Kantonian: in-game trade at Turffield (both versions); Alolan: Diglett Master gift or Max Lair (inferred) or HOME; Galarian: wild.",
  "77": "Kantonian Ponyta: Regina’s trade, Shield only; Galarian: Shield only.",
  "83": "Galarian: Sword only; Kantonian: Regina’s trade for a Galarian one (so a trade first in Shield, inferred).",
  "144": "Kantonian: Dynamax Adventures (both); Galarian: Crown Tundra roaming. Same for 145 and 146.",
  "222": "Galarian: Shield only; Johtonian: Regina’s trade for a Galarian one.",
  "422": "East Sea in the wild in Galar; West Sea only from HOME (Serebii’s Transfer Only). Same for 423.",
  "487": "Origin Forme while holding the Griseous Orb (Stow-on-Side, Serebii’s item page); held-item form (inferred: shown in boxes while held).",
  "550": "Red-Striped: Sword wild; Blue-Striped: Shield wild; both in the Max Lair list (inferred both in Shield). White-Striped is Hisui only (Serebii).",
  "554": "Galarian: Sword only; Unovan: Regina’s trade, Sword only (Serebii: Shield “Trade from Pokémon Sword”). Same for 555.",
  "555": "Zen Mode (Unovan and Galarian) is battle-only, left out.",
  "641": "Therian Forme with the Reveal Glass (Stow-on-Side). Same for 642 and 645.",
  "646": "Black and White Kyurem with the DNA Splicers (Stow-on-Side), fused with Zekrom (Shield) or Reshiram (Sword, so a trade).",
  "647": "Resolute Form when it knows Secret Sword (learnt at Lv. 1 in Sword/Shield, Serebii).",
  "649": "Drive forms while holding a Drive (Stow-on-Side); held-item forms.",
  "678": "Male and female look different; Serebii shows them as Gender Differences, HOME as forms. Same for 876 (Indeedee).",
  "718": "10% and 50% with the Zygarde Cube (Stow-on-Side); Complete Forme is battle-only, left out.",
  "773": "Type forms while holding a Memory (Battle Tower); held-item forms.",
  "800": "Dusk Mane (with Solgaleo, Sword: a trade) and Dawn Wings (with Lunala, Shield) using the N-Solarizer / N-Lunarizer (Stow-on-Side); Ultra Necrozma is battle-only.",
  "801": "Original Color: HOME only.",
  "869": "Serebii writes only the cream (each seven times); the sweets are read from its picture names (berry, love, star, clover, flower, ribbon; the plain one strawberry), inferred.",
  "876": "Max Lair list has the male (inferred in Shield too); wild: female in Shield, male in Sword.",
  "888": "Crowned while holding the Rusted Sword (Sword); held-item form. Whether boxes show it Crowned: unsure. Same for 889 with the Rusted Shield.",
  "893": "Both forms by event only.",
  "898": "Riders by fusing with Glastrier or Spectrier with the Reins of Unity (Freezington); you get one steed per save, the other by trade."
 },
